    "body": "When someone on iOS taps an invite link from the Divine mobile app and doesn't have the app installed, they hit a 404. The code is lost.\n\nThis PR adds a web fallback at /invite/:code that reads the code, validates it against /v1/validate, and shows the user either a pre-filled form or an error state. Submitting the form hands the invite off to the login flow.\n\nAlso adds a Smart App Banner for iOS Safari so users without the app get prompted to install it.\n\nTranslations across all 16 locales are stubbed in with English placeholders — proper translations can follow once the copy is locked.\n\nDraft PR with full context: https://github.com/divinevideo/divine-web/pull/385",
